      177   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-3
      178        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      179        SIZE 96.5 BY 5.5.
      180   DEFINE QUERY Dialog-Frame FOR
      181         tt-wth-ser SCROLLING.
      182   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      183        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1.13 WIDGET-ID 2
      184        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 11.13 WIDGET-ID 8
      185        B-hist AT ROW 1 COL 61 WIDGET-ID 6
